# The submission needs no credentials to run: it is a deterministic,
# standard-library-only pipeline and makes no network calls.
#
# Optional configuration (copy to .env and export, or set in the shell):
#
#   Path to an alternative screenshot transcription cache. The cache is keyed by
#   the SHA-256 of each image so a changed artefact invalidates its entry.
# EVIDENCE_VISION_CACHE=code/evidence_cache/images.json
#
# Never commit real credentials. This file intentionally contains no keys.
